[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17040.15, "timestamp": "04:44:00", "text": "本身就很不可思议了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17043.67, "timestamp": "04:44:03", "text": "不，很快就会让我感到惊讶。   但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17046.47, "timestamp": "04:44:06", "text": "如何实现呢？ 我只是在建造。 我一直在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17049.99, "timestamp": "04:44:09", "text": "强迫自己专注于建筑之类的事情。   就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17070.868, "timestamp": "04:44:30", "text": "如果阿斯特劳恩现在还在场，他早就"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17074.628, "timestamp": "04:44:34", "text": "压制了我们的董事会。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17076.31, "timestamp": "04:44:36", "text": "好的。 是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17078.55, "timestamp": "04:44:38", "text": "他56级了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17081.11, "timestamp": "04:44:41", "text": "是的，他是回归球员。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17092.15, "timestamp": "04:44:52", "text": "这本身就很疯狂。   是的"}]